    "causal_summary": "Plan the Deep Review resume adapter for interruption-safe recovery from the sealed typed event ledger. The adapter folds the shared review-loop history through versioned reducers, maps the continuity ladder from scope through dimension passes, findings, convergence, and review-report, and re-enters idempotently without double-applying, losing, or replaying events.",
